<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><view class="title">手动添加</view></view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="label">服务名称</text>
    <input class="input" value="{{issuer}}" bindinput="onIssuer" placeholder="如 GitHub" placeholder-class="ph" />

    <text class="label">账户</text>
    <input class="input" value="{{account}}" bindinput="onAccount" placeholder="如 alice@example.com" placeholder-class="ph" />

    <text class="label">种子密钥</text>
    <input class="input mono" value="{{secret}}" bindinput="onSecret" placeholder="Base32 字符串" placeholder-class="ph" />
    <view class="hint">
      种子通常在服务网站的"设置 → 安全 → 两步验证"页面,以 Base32 字符串或二维码形式给出。空格可忽略,大小写不敏感。
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-item">
        <text class="label">算法</text>
        <picker
          mode="selector"
          range="{{algorithms}}"
          value="{{algorithmIndex}}"
          bindchange="onAlgorithm"
        ><view class="picker">{{algorithms[algorithmIndex]}}</view></picker>
      </view>
      <view class="row-item">
        <text class="label">位数</text>
        <picker
          mode="selector"
          range="{{digitOptions}}"
          value="{{digitIndex}}"
          bindchange="onDigits"
        ><view class="picker">{{digits}} 位</view></picker>
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="label">时间周期</text>
    <picker
      mode="selector"
      range="{{periodOptions}}"
      value="{{periodIndex}}"
      bindchange="onPeriod"
    ><view class="picker">{{period}} 秒</view></picker>

    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>

    <view
      class="btn {{canSubmit ? '' : 'btn-disabled'}}"
      bindtap="onSubmit"
    >保存</view>
  </view>

  <view class="hint">
    绝大多数服务使用 SHA1 / 6 位 / 30 秒。若不确定,保持默认即可——填错会导致验证码始终无效。
  </view>
</view>
